SUMMARY:[Beginner (& More) Hiking/ Adventure Group - SLC] Moab Camping + Hiking Weekend
DESCRIPTION:Let’s make some memories somewhere between the red dirt and the endless blue sky.\n\nI’m planning two nights of camping in Moab\, heading down Friday\, November 6 and coming home Sunday\, November 8.\n\nThe plan is simple: campfires 🔥\, good company\, and plenty of red rock sauntering. I’d love to catch sunrise and sunset at different arches\, and build out some great hiking routes together depending on what everyone feels up for.\n\nCamp location TBD once we have a better idea of group size.\n\nBring your camping gear\, hiking shoes\, warm layers\, food and drinks .. and most importantly\, bring your sense of adventure and awe.\n\nGroup: Beginner (& More) Hiking/ Adventure Group - SLC\nImage: https://i.groupme.com/1800x1200.jpeg.bdfa405d7e8a493a964c2a9eb3549452
LOCATION:Arches National Park\, Moab\, UT\, 84532
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
